          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><b>Advancing personalized surgery</b>, </span></span><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">together</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b2b4ae;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><b><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Proud to provide you with 3D Systems' medical models and VSP<sup>®</sup> solutions</span></b></span></span></p>\n",
